5,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hello everyone! This is going to be so much fun! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's keep a cool head. We have no information yet, so we should just observe.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. A quiet start is best. Let us see how the conversation flows naturally.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! I'll help everyone find the bad guy! Who do you think is suspicious?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is far too early for suspicions, Kenji. Let us maintain our elegance and observe the patterns.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,@Kenji is so energetic! I like it! Does anyone have a plan for how we should vote?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,I think we should wait for the Seer to provide a lead before making any hasty decisions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,That is the most rational approach. We should avoid guessing on the first day.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,That makes sense! I'll just watch everyone carefully then!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. Logic dictates that we gather data before drawing conclusions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
