31,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. Did anything happen last night?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"No one died, as expected. Now we have to decide who to vote for.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have information. Mio, I am sorry, but you are the werewolf.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,What?! Mio? No way! She's way too cheerful to be a werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A very direct claim from Jonathan. Are you the Seer, Jonathan?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mio,,"What?! Jonathan, that's not true! Why would you say that about me? I'm just a villager!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, the result is definitive. But we must consider if he is lying.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am the Seer. My divination was clear. I have no reason to deceive the village.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,But this is so sudden! Maybe the Seer is actually the werewolf trying to trick us?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a possibility, though Jonathan's composure is quite consistent with his personality.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Please don't believe him! I'm innocent! @Benjamin, @Misaki, you have to trust me!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm looking at the logic. If we execute Mio and she's the werewolf, we win immediately.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Exactly. The risk of executing a villager is high, but the reward of ending the game is higher.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to vote for Mio... but if Jonathan is really the Seer, we have to.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The efficiency of a Day 1 win is tempting. Mio, your reaction is quite emotional.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm emotional because I'm being framed! This is unfair!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll trust the Seer's claim. Jonathan seems sincere.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I guess I'll go with the majority. I'm sorry, Mio!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. The logical choice is to follow the Seer's lead.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
